config TI_MATHLIB_FASTRTS
	bool "TI TMU fast math functions"
	depends on SOC_SERIES_AM13E
	depends on FPU
	depends on ARMV8_M_CDE_CP0
	help
	  Fast single-precision sin, cos, atan, atan2, asin, acos, sqrt, exp,
	  log and divide implemented on the AM13 Trigonometric Math Unit (TMU),
	  a Cortex-M33 coprocessor accessed through Arm CDE instructions.
	  See <mathlib/fastrts_tmu.h>.

	  Enables access to coprocessor 0 at boot. The compiler cdecp0 feature
	  comes from ARMV8_M_CDE_CP0, selected by the SoC.
